  "description": "“Seohyun, you're pretty. More than I imagined.”\n\nI just spent a night with the CEO I had a crush on, and now our bodies have switched?!\n\nAn agonizing, unrequited love. I had given up on him because he was someone I couldn't even dare to look at, but through a cruel twist of fate, Seohyun ends up spending a night with Dohyuk, the CEO she harbored feelings for.\n\nShe resolved to keep it as a fond one-night memory, but somehow, when she opens her eyes, she has swapped bodies with the CEO?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14441656), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002711)",
